OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance hub in 'desperate' need
OL,4,Aof upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ambulance base is "not fit for
OL,7,Fpurpose" according to an NHS trust,
OL,8,Fwhich says the centre is "in desperate
OL,9,Fneed of investment".
OL,11,FSouth Central Ambulance Service (SCAS)
OL,12,FNHS Foundation Trust is seeking
OL,13,Fpermission to upgrade its hub in High
OL,14,FWycombe, Buckinghamshire.
OL,16,FThe centre, where ambulance crews and
OL,17,Fsupport staff are based along with the
OL,18,Femergency vehicles, is on West End
OL,19,FStreet.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
