OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance hub in 'desperate' need
OL,4,Aof upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Field, the trust's head of
OL,7,Festates and capital works, said: "The
OL,8,Fsite, originally constructed in 1955 -
OL,9,Fover 70 years ago - is in a poor state
OL,10,Fof condition."
